OL,3,GNEWSABGT winners donate prize money to
OL,4,Ahelp farmers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA choir that won this year's Britain's
OL,7,FGot Talent is donating #50,000 of its
OL,8,Fprize money to help farmers.
OL,10,FThe Hawkstone Farmers Choir will
OL,11,Fofficially hand over the donation to
OL,12,Ffive charities supporting farming,
OL,13,Fmental health, and rural communities at
OL,14,Fan event held at Jeremy Clarkson's pub,
OL,15,FThe Farmer's Dog, near Burford on
OL,16,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,338,330,200,160,0,100
