OL,3,GNEWSABGT winners donate prize money to
OL,4,Ahelp farmers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe donation from the choir - which was
OL,7,Fset up by the TV presenter to support
OL,8,Ffarmers with their mental health -
OL,9,Fmarks the first charitable donation
OL,10,Ffrom their #250,000 Britain's Got
OL,11,FTalent prize money.
OL,13,FClarkson's alcohol brand Hawkstone is
OL,14,Fmatching the donation pound-for-pound,
OL,15,Fbringing the total contribution to
OL,16,F#100,000.
